\begin{enumerate}
\item We introduce a novel mesh tokenization method, named Adjacent Mesh Tokenization (AMT). Compared to previous tokenization methods, AMT requires approximately half the token sequence length to represent the same mesh, thereby fundamentally reducing the computational burden of Artist-Created Mesh generation.
\item We equip MeshAnything with AMT and introduce MeshAnything V2. V2 doubles the maximum number of faces that can be generated while achieving significantly better accuracy and efficiency.
